    "problemStatement": "You are given a permutation PPP of length NNN.\n\nIn one operation, you can:\n\n\nSelect a set SSS of **unique indices** {i1,i2,…,iK}\\{i_1, i_2, \\ldots, i_K\\}{i1​,i2​,…,iK​} where:\n\nKKK is **even**;\n1≤ij≤N1\\le i_j \\le N1≤ij​≤N for all 1≤j≤K1\\le j \\le K1≤j≤K.\n\n\nSwap the pairs Pi1P_{i_1}Pi1​​ with Pi2P_{i_2}Pi2​​, Pi3P_{i_3}Pi3​​ with Pi4P_{i_4}Pi4​​, …\\ldots…, Pi(K−1)P_{i_{(K-1)}}Pi(K−1)​​ with PiKP_{i_K}PiK​​.\nYour task is to sort the permutation PPP in increasing order using **at most ⌈log⁡2N⌉\\lceil{\\log_2N}\\rceil⌈log2​N⌉** operations.\n\nNote that you need to print the sequence of operations that sort the permutation.\n\nIf multiple solutions exist, you may print any. It is guaranteed that a solution always exists for the input.\n\nA permutation of length NNN consists of all integers from 111 to NNN exactly once.\n\nAlso, ⌈x⌉\\lceil{x}\\rceil⌈x⌉ denotes the ceiling function. For example, ⌈2.3⌉=3\\lceil{2.3}\\rceil = 3⌈2.3⌉=3.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line of input will contain a single integer TTT, denoting the number of test cases.\nEach test case consists of multiple lines of input.\n\nThe first line of each test case contains NNN — the length of the permutation.\nThe next line contains a permutation PPP of length NNN.\n\n\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, output M+1M+1M+1 lines where MMM denotes the number of operations required to sort the permutation:\n\n\n\nIn the first line, print a single integer MMM.\nThe ithi^{th}ith of the next MMM lines should contain Ki+1K_i+1Ki​+1 space separated integers:\n\nThe first integer in the ithi^{th}ith line is an even integer KiK_iKi​ denoting the size of the set chosen for the ithi^{th}ith operation.\nThe next KiK_iKi​ integers denote the set of indices for the ithi^{th}ith operation.\n\n\n\nNote that the following conditions should satisfy:\n\n\n\n0≤M≤⌈log⁡2N⌉0\\le M \\le \\lceil{\\log_2N}\\rceil0≤M≤⌈log2​N⌉;\n2≤Ki≤N2\\le K_i \\le N2≤Ki​≤N, and KKK is **even**;\nFor each operation, the set of indices chosen is unique.",
